2
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:34,500
君に 逢いたい時だって
Even when I want to see you,

3
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:38,200
どこか 逢えない気持ちがある
deep down I feel like I can't.

4
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:41,800
だけど 本当の優しさが
But true kindness

5
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:46,000
そこに あるかも知れない
might be right there.

6
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:03,200
人込みに 揺られている
Swayed by the crowd,

7
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:06,800
どこかに 宛てがあるわけじゃない
it's not like I have anywhere to go.

8
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:10,200
独りきり 歩いても
Even if I walk all alone,

9
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:13,600
何か 解決することじゃない
it won't solve anything.

10
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:17,000
自分が 本当に望んでる
What I truly desire...

11
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,200
気持ちは きっと
...is a feeling that surely means...

12
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:23,600
これから 二人で
...walking forward together...

13
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:27,800
歩いて行くことさ
...from now on.

14
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:31,200
君に 逢いたい時だって
Even when I want to see you,

15
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:34,500
どこか 逢えない気持ちがある
deep down I feel like I can't.

16
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:38,200
だけど本当の優しさが
But true kindness

17
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:41,800
そこに あるかも知れない
might be right there.

18
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:45,000
二人 輝いた季節は
The season we sparkled together

19
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:48,500
きっと これからも続いてく
will surely keep continuing from now on.

20
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:51,800
だから 大切な未来に
So, into our precious future,

21
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:55,500
この想いを 残したい
I want to leave these feelings behind.

22
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:11,400
飽きるまで 話しても
Even if we talk until we're tired,

23
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:14,800
全部 分かり合えるわけじゃない
it doesn't mean we'll understand everything.

24
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:18,200
言葉より 伝えたい
Words can't fully express...

25
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:21,800
気持ちが この胸にあふれてる
...the feelings overflowing in my heart.

26
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:25,200
君がいつか 探した夢の
The continuation of the dream you once sought...

27
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:28,400
続きは きっと
...let's surely...

28
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:31,800
二人で 描いて行こう
...draw it together as two.

29
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:36,000
忘れないで
Please don't forget.

30
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:39,500
独りきり 孤独なようで
Though it feels like we're alone in solitude,

31
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:43,000
皆 何かに悩んでいる
everyone is troubling over something.

32
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:46,500
すぐには 変わらないけれど
Things won't change right away,

33
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:50,000
とにかく 信じていたい
but I just want to keep believing.

34
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,400
流した 涙拭き去って
Wiping away the shed tears,

35
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:56,800
ずっと 君のそばで生きたい
I want to live by your side forever.

36
00:04:56,800 --> 00:05:00,200
いつか 振り返った時に
Because when I look back someday,

37
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:03,000
後悔 したくないから
I don't want to have any regrets.

38
00:05:34,128 --> 00:05:39,128
君に...
To you...

39
00:05:39,828 --> 00:05:44,528
会いたいと言いたくて
I want to tell you that I want to see you

40
00:05:47,528 --> 00:05:57,928
二人 輝いた季節は
The season when the two of us shone...

41
00:06:06,328 --> 00:06:11,828
後悔したくないから
Because I don't want to have any regrets

42
00:06:41,328 --> 00:06:44,128
叶わない 夢なんて
A dream that won't come true...

43
00:06:44,128 --> 00:06:48,128
簡単に 口にはしたくない
I don't want to speak of it so easily

44
00:06:48,128 --> 00:06:51,128
諦めた 瞬間（とき）に
The moment you give up,

45
00:06:51,128 --> 00:06:54,828
自分自身 終わらせてるだけ
you're just putting an end to yourself.

46
00:06:54,828 --> 00:06:58,328
もっと 単純に感じたい
I want to feel things more simply.

47
00:06:58,328 --> 00:07:01,328
君のこと いつも
About you, always...

48
00:07:01,328 --> 00:07:04,128
素直に 笑うよ
I'll smile honestly.

49
00:07:04,128 --> 00:07:08,828
未来は 続いてく
The future goes on.

50
00:07:09,128 --> 00:07:12,328
君が ホントに スキだって
That I really like you,

51
00:07:12,328 --> 00:07:16,128
いつも 心に飾ってたい
I always want to keep that in my heart.

52
00:07:16,128 --> 00:07:19,328
楽しさだけが 全てなら
If fun is all there is,

53
00:07:19,328 --> 00:07:23,328
本当の 愛じゃないから
then it isn't real love.

54
00:07:24,128 --> 00:07:29,328
君に...
To you...

55
00:07:29,828 --> 00:07:35,328
会いたいと言いたくて
I want to tell you that I want to see you.

56
00:07:36,528 --> 00:07:43,828
二人 輝いた季節は きっと これからも続いてく
The season when the two of us shone will surely continue from now on.

57
00:07:43,828 --> 00:07:51,128
だから 大切な未来に この想いを残したい
So, I want to leave these feelings for our precious future.

58
00:07:51,328 --> 00:07:56,328
君に...
To you...

59
00:07:56,828 --> 00:08:01,828
会いたいと言いたくて
I want to tell you that I want to see you.

60
00:08:03,528 --> 00:08:13,828
二人 輝いた季節は...
The season when the two of us shone...

61
00:08:33,528 --> 00:08:37,828
みんな6周年ライブに来てくれてアリぺコ！
Everyone, thanks for coming to my 6th anniversary live, peko!

62
00:08:37,828 --> 00:08:40,328
そして大変お待たせしました！
And sorry to keep you waiting for so long!

63
00:08:40,528 --> 00:08:42,528
そうそう！そうそう！
Right, right! Right, right!

64
00:08:42,528 --> 00:08:48,828
けどね、みんなに楽しんでもらえるようなライブになってるぺコだから、ぜひともお楽しみに！
But you know, it's going to be a live concert everyone can enjoy, so please look forward to it!

65
00:08:49,128 --> 00:08:53,328
そして1曲目は「そこにあるかも知れない…」を歌わせてもらったぺコ！
And for the first song, I sang "Soko ni Aru Kamo Shirenai..." peko!

66
00:08:53,328 --> 00:08:59,828
ま、っていうことは今回のテーマは…そう！パチスロ第2弾！
Which means this time's theme is... yes! Pachislot Part 2!

67
00:09:02,128 --> 00:09:11,328
当たり演出もね、めちゃめちゃいろいろありますんで、ぜひとも次の曲は何が来るかなって考えながら楽しんでもらえたら嬉しいぺコ！
There are all kinds of jackpot effects, so I hope you'll enjoy guessing what the next song will be!

68
00:09:11,328 --> 00:09:14,528
そして、今回のハッシュタグはこちら！
And the hashtag for today is right here!

69
00:09:14,528 --> 00:09:21,328
「#兎田ぺこら6周年記念LIVE」ぺコなので、たくさんポストしてください！
It's #UsadaPekora6thAnniversaryLIVE peko, so please post a lot!

70
00:09:21,528 --> 00:09:25,328
ちゅうわけで、そんじゃ早速回していくか！
So with that said, let me spin the reels right away!

71
00:09:25,328 --> 00:09:27,328
よいしょ！あれ？
Heave-ho! Huh?

72
00:09:29,828 --> 00:09:30,828
お！
Oh!

73
00:09:30,828 --> 00:09:32,828
あ、始まった！
Ah, it started!

74
00:09:41,828 --> 00:09:45,828
運命の一撃
A strike of fate!

75
00:09:46,328 --> 00:09:49,328
好機 好機 好機
Chance! Chance! Chance!

76
00:09:50,528 --> 00:09:54,528
笑うべきだと分かった時は 泣くべきじゃねえぺこ！
When you know you should laugh, you shouldn't cry, peko!

77
00:09:54,828 --> 00:09:58,828
運命の一撃を叩き込め！
Strike with the blow of fate!

78
00:10:01,273 --> 00:10:02,073
3

79
