1

81
00:10:34,873 --> 00:10:37,673
咲かすか 枯らすか 現在
Whether to make it bloom or wither now,

82
00:10:37,773 --> 00:10:40,173
燃えるように 日が沈む
as if burning, the sun sets.

83
00:10:40,273 --> 00:10:44,873
歯車が回る
The gears turn.

84
00:10:55,273 --> 00:11:01,273
ラッパが鳴れば チャッカ サマザマな 楽しの物語
When the trumpet sounds, igniting various enjoyable stories.

85
00:11:01,373 --> 00:11:05,173
発車 ガラガラ トッシャ ガラガラ
Departures clattering, arrivals rattling.

86
00:11:05,273 --> 00:11:09,573
真っ赤な過去が多い 影る 道化師の笑み
Shadowed by a crimson past, a clown's smile...

87
00:11:09,673 --> 00:11:12,973
仮面の裏側
Behind the mask.

88
00:11:13,073 --> 00:11:18,173
どんなに消しても消えない 傷を抱いたんだとしても
Even if bearing wounds that can never be erased no matter how much you try,

89
00:11:18,273 --> 00:11:21,173
咲かすか 枯らすか 現在
whether to make it bloom or wither now,

90
00:11:21,273 --> 00:11:24,273
燃えるように 日が沈む
as if burning, the sun sets.

91
00:11:24,373 --> 00:11:28,173
真夜中の暗い 孤独から
From the dark solitude of midnight,

92
00:11:28,273 --> 00:11:30,473
繰り出す
reaching out.

93
00:11:30,573 --> 00:11:33,073
微かな 響く鐘が
A faintly ringing bell...

94
00:11:33,173 --> 00:11:35,673
陰る日々の 道標
A signpost through shadowy days,

95
00:11:35,773 --> 00:11:38,873
音の鳴る先へ
towards where the sound leads.

96
00:11:44,573 --> 00:11:50,473
ラッパが鳴れば チャッカ ワラワラ マッカな幕の真ん中
When the trumpet sounds, igniting giggles in the middle of a crimson curtain.

97
00:11:50,573 --> 00:11:56,473
はまだかまさか さかさまのまま 紡ぐ論理
Is it not yet? No way, spinning logic while upside down.

98
00:11:56,573 --> 00:12:01,273
足を掴まれ 奈落の底まで
Grabbed by the feet down to the bottom of the abyss.

99
00:12:01,373 --> 00:12:07,273
脚色も忘れて 息もできない
Forgetting dramatization, unable to even breathe.

100
00:12:07,373 --> 00:12:10,273
咲かすか 枯らすか 現在
Whether to make it bloom or wither now,

101
00:12:10,373 --> 00:12:13,373
眠るように 目を閉じる
closing eyes as if falling asleep.

102
00:12:13,473 --> 00:12:17,373
身体中巡る 猛毒から
From the deadly poison circulating through the body,

103
00:12:17,473 --> 00:12:19,673
逃げ出す
escaping.

104
00:12:19,773 --> 00:12:22,173
微かな 響く鐘に
To the faintly ringing bell,

105
00:12:22,273 --> 00:12:24,673
耳を澄ませ 生きるのか
listen closely—will I live?

106
00:12:24,773 --> 00:12:29,073
どちらか選べ
Choose one or the other.

107
00:12:29,173 --> 00:12:30,573
さあ
Now!

108
00:12:51,973 --> 00:12:58,273
快感も 罰ゲームのように 未来だけ 想えばいい
Even pleasure is like a punishment game; just think of the future.

109
00:12:58,373 --> 00:13:06,173
過去の亡霊を 消してー！
Erase the ghosts of the past!

110
00:13:06,273 --> 00:13:09,173
咲かすか 枯らすか 現在
Whether to make it bloom or wither now,

111
00:13:09,273 --> 00:13:12,373
燃えるように 日が沈む
as if burning, the sun sets.

112
00:13:12,473 --> 00:13:16,273
真夜中の深い 孤独から
From the deep solitude of midnight,

113
00:13:16,373 --> 00:13:18,673
繰り出す
reaching out.

114
00:13:18,773 --> 00:13:22,673
運命が 壊れるような 声で叫べ
Shout in a voice that seems to shatter fate!

115
00:13:22,773 --> 00:13:28,373
始まりの合図 幕開け さあ 舞って踊れ
The signal to begin, the curtain rises! Come on, dance and spin!

116
00:13:28,473 --> 00:13:32,573
誰しも 最期には 涙流す
Everyone sheds tears at the very end.

117
00:13:32,673 --> 00:13:36,073
だから今は こらえ進む
So for now, endure and move forward.

118
00:13:36,173 --> 00:13:40,073
幕が下りる その時まで まだ
Until the curtain falls, not yet.

119
00:13:40,173 --> 00:13:46,973
絶えず 歯車が回る
Endlessly, the gears turn.

120
00:14:29,673 --> 00:14:33,673
究極Vモンキー！
Ultimate V-Monkey!

121
00:14:55,673 --> 00:14:59,173
何かをするのに
To do something...

122
00:14:59,273 --> 00:15:02,673
理由なんか要らないね
We don't need any reason, do we?

123
00:15:02,887 --> 00:15:04,687
熱くなるよ
It's getting hot,

124
00:15:04,687 --> 00:15:08,387
君を見ているだけで
just by looking at you.

125
00:15:08,387 --> 00:15:11,687
戦っているのよ
I am fighting.

126
00:15:11,687 --> 00:15:14,687
期待はどんな時でも
Expectations, no matter when,

127
00:15:14,687 --> 00:15:17,387
もつれて 迷い込む
get tangled up and stray.

128
00:15:17,387 --> 00:15:19,087
イチカバチカ
All or nothing,

129
00:15:19,087 --> 00:15:21,887
夢に向かい加速する
accelerating towards the dream.

130
00:15:21,887 --> 00:15:24,687
ココロが止まらない
My heart won't stop.

131
00:15:24,687 --> 00:15:26,387
感じてる
I can feel it.

132
00:15:26,387 --> 00:15:29,387
悩み多き日常のターンに
In this turn of daily life full of worries,

133
00:15:29,387 --> 00:15:35,087
君といる時の自分が一番好きだよ
I like myself best when I'm with you.

134
00:15:35,687 --> 00:15:37,687
ココロは止まらない
My heart won't stop.

135
00:15:37,687 --> 00:15:39,687
光の中
In the middle of the light,

136
00:15:39,687 --> 00:15:42,687
七色の水ふぶきあげて
splashing a rainbow spray of water,

137
00:15:42,687 --> 00:15:47,887
新しい明日の風に向かい 走り出そうよ
let's start running toward the wind of a new tomorrow.

138
00:15:47,887 --> 00:15:50,687
二人きりで
Just the two of us.

139
00:16:03,387 --> 00:16:07,087
会いたい気持ちが
My desire to see you

140
00:16:07,087 --> 00:16:10,687
ため息に溶けていく
melts away into a sigh.

141
00:16:10,687 --> 00:16:16,387
寂しい夜はそばにいてくれた
You stayed by my side on lonely nights.

142
00:16:16,387 --> 00:16:19,687
泣き出しそうになった時
When I was about to burst into tears,

143
00:16:19,687 --> 00:16:23,087
気づかないふりしてくれたね
you pretended not to notice.

144
00:16:23,087 --> 00:16:26,887
重ねる唇から
From our overlapping lips,

145
00:16:26,887 --> 00:16:30,387
こぼれる切なさも愛しさも
both sadness and affection overflow.

146
00:16:30,387 --> 00:16:33,087
ココロが止まらない
My heart won't stop.

147
00:16:33,087 --> 00:16:34,687
感じてる
I can feel it.

148
00:16:34,687 --> 00:16:37,087
もっと全ても変えてみたい
I want to change everything even more.

149
00:16:37,087 --> 00:16:43,387
願った奇跡がこんなにも近くにあったよ
The miracle I wished for was right here so close to me.

150
00:16:43,387 --> 00:16:45,687
ココロは止まらない
My heart won't stop.

151
00:16:45,687 --> 00:16:47,687
通り過ぎた
Having passed by,

152
00:16:47,687 --> 00:16:50,887
夏のにおい懐かしいね
the scent of summer feels so nostalgic.

153
00:16:50,887 --> 00:16:56,687
君を好きになってから前より寂しがり屋に
Since I fell for you, I've become lonelier than before,

154
00:16:56,687 --> 00:16:58,687
なってしまった
I have become.

155
00:17:23,387 --> 00:17:27,687
こわいものはたった一つ
There's only one thing that scares me:

156
00:17:27,687 --> 00:17:30,687
君が優しすぎること
that you are far too kind.

157
00:17:30,687 --> 00:17:33,687
たそがれが風止めても
Even if twilight stops the wind,

158
00:17:33,687 --> 00:17:37,887
夢へのブレーキかからない
there's no braking on the way to my dream.

159
00:17:37,887 --> 00:17:40,687
ココロが止まらない
My heart won't stop.

160
00:17:40,687 --> 00:17:42,087
感じてる
I can feel it.

161
00:17:42,087 --> 00:17:44,687
きっと答えは一つじゃない
Surely there isn't just one answer.

162
00:17:44,687 --> 00:17:51,387
君に会うためだけにとても優しくなれるよ
Just to meet you, I can become so gentle.

163
00:17:51,387 --> 00:17:53,687
ココロは止まらない
My heart won't stop.

164
00:17:53,687 --> 00:17:55,687
月の雫
Drops of the moon,

165
00:17:55,687 --> 00:17:58,687
ずっと君を探してた
I was searching for you all this time.

166
00:17:58,687 --> 00:18:04,087
同じ時 同じ星見上げてこのままきっと
Looking up at the same star at the same time, surely just like this,

167
